  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="5f5c-355d-f3f2-ec97" name="Illyrians (Alexander the Great) - List Notes" publicationId="0641-2ee1-c462-c414" hidden="false">
      <description>ILLYRIANS - BARBARIAN ALLIES &amp; ENEMIES (Alexander the Great, p.85). Percentages are by points. Characters up to 25% (the army must have a Warlord and he is the Army General). Warriors at least 50%. Skirmishers up to 10%. Cavalry up to 15%.
The minimum size for a regiment is five models, there is no upper limit. One model in each unit may be upgraded to Leader (+5 pts), and Musician (+5 pts), or Standard bearer (+5 pts). Not enforced: one Slave unit per warrior unit; Slave Warriors may not outnumber warriors; skirmisher units may not outnumber any Warrior unit; only a single unit may have light armour.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Illyrians]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Warriors: at least 50%
  Skirmishers: up to 10%
  Cavalry: up to 15%
  ILLYRIANS - BARBARIAN ALLIES &amp; ENEMIES (Alexander the Great, p.85). Percentages are by points. Characters up to 25% (the army must have a Warlord and he is the Army General). Warriors at least 50%. Skirmishers up to 10%. Cavalry up to 15%.
The minimum size for a regiment is five models, there is no upper limit. One model in each unit may be upgraded to Leader (+5 pts), and Musician (+5 pts), or Standard bearer (+5 pts). Not enforced: one Slave unit per warrior unit; Slave Warriors may not outnumber warriors; skirmisher units may not outnumber any Warrior unit; only a single unit may have light armour.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
